# Acer Crate

**Acer Crate** is a free, modern and independent alternative to Acer NitroSense, designed for Acer Nitro gaming laptops.

Acer Crate brings performance management, real-time hardware monitoring, cooling controls, and system customization together in one clean and intuitive application.

## Features

- **Real-Time Monitoring** — Monitor CPU and GPU temperatures, usage, fan speeds, RAM, and storage.
- **Fan Control** — Manage cooling settings and adjust fan speeds.
- **Performance Modes** — Choose between Quiet, Balanced, Performance, and My Mode.
- **Keyboard Lighting** — Customize keyboard backlighting on supported laptops.
- **Custom Presets** — Create and save personalized configurations.
- **Automation** — Manage automated system settings.
- **System Diagnostics** — Access hardware information and diagnostic tools.
- **Modern UI** — Minimalist dark interface with teal accents.
- **Multilingual Support** — English and Russian.

## System Requirements

- Windows 10 or Windows 11
- Acer Nitro gaming laptop
- Recommended model: Acer Nitro 5 AN515-58
- Administrator permissions may be required for certain hardware controls.

## Installation

1. Open the [Releases](https://github.com/vergulesmatvey-oss/Acer-Crate/releases) page.
